* {{cite certification|region=Canada|type=single|artist=Lady Gaga|title=Poker Face|award=Platinum|number=8|access-date=September 18, 2013}}</ref><ref name="Korean Top 100 International Singles 2010">{{cite web |date=February 10, 2011 |title=2010년 가온차트 부문별 Top 100위 - 국외 |url=http://gaonchart.co.kr/main/section/notice/view.gaon?idx=39 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130319075835/http://gaonchart.co.kr/main/section/notice/view.gaon?idx=39 |archive-date=March 19, 2013 |access-date=September 18, 2013 |publisher=Gaonchart}}</ref> More than fifteen years after its release, "Poker Face" entered the [[Billboard Global 200|''Billboard'' Global 200]], established in 2020, and later peaked at number 45 on May 17, 2025, spending 63 weeks on the ranking.<ref name="Global200" />

